[1m[38;5;231mInclude a "Remember me" opt-out in v1?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mYes, add the checkbox (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mAdds a rememberUsername boolean preference plus a checkbox. Unchecking clears the stored username. Gives users a [39m
     [38;5;246mway to turn it off on a shared machine.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m No, always remember
     [38;5;246mKeeps v1 to exactly the scope you picked. No UI change. No way for a user to stop or clear the remembered username.
[39m  [38;5;246m3.[39m No checkbox, default off
     [38;5;246mShip the preference and the prefill, but leave it disabled until a later change adds the UI to enable it. Nothing [39m
     [38;5;246mis stored in v1.[39m
